Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Group symptoms by plausible shared mechanisms such as unstable interfaces or manual coordination. Distinguish architectural causes from staffing or process issues, and formulate checks that could disconfirm the proposed technical explanation.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
